                    d_chief_retier: `Re-tier modestly while keeping controls`,
                    d_chief_cave: `Loosen access to defuse the conflict`,
                    d_discount_label: `Vendor's confidential offer`,
                    d_discount_hint: `CardioNova offers a price cut or an outcomes-based deal to manage uncertainty.`,
                    d_discount_reject: `Decline — keep list price`,
